<title>UK: FEK sets 500 mln Swedish crown Dec 2003 bond. [CORRECTED 17:00 GMT]</title>
<headline>FEK sets 500 mln Swedish crown Dec 2003 bond. [CORRECTED 17:00 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Svenska Handelsbanken.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FINNISH EXPORT CREDIT</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN SEK   COUPON     6.0	 MATURITY    18.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.586   PAY DATE  S-12.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    =	   S SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p>(Corrects Moody's rating from Aa2)</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.25</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED UNDER AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>		SENIOR, UNSECURED AND UNSUBORDINATED.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
